# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Pulse Market - frontend environment template
#
# SECURITY: Vite inlines every VITE_* variable into the JavaScript bundle.
# Anything here is PUBLIC. Never put a database password, service_role key,
# Cloudinary API secret, or any other server credential in a VITE_ variable.
# Those live only in apps/api/.env, which is gitignored and never bundled.
#
# Do not copy this file to the repo root. Vite's root is apps/web.
# Do not commit a filled apps/web/.env.
#
# On Cloudflare Pages, set variables under Settings -> Environment variables.
# They are read at BUILD time, so a change requires a new deploy.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Absolute origin of the Express API (no path). Local development: leave empty
# so the browser calls same-origin /api and Vite proxies to :3000.
#
# Production (Pages): set to the public API origin, e.g. https://api.example.com
# That host must list the Pages origin in FRONTEND_URL (API env), or CORS blocks
# the browser. This is a URL, not a secret.
VITE_API_URL=
